  "segments": [
    {
      "line": 1,
      "text": "1.前往法兰城凯蒂夫人店门口与裘瑟斯（195.69）对话。（此步可省略）",
      "type": "optional-step",
      "sourceLines": [
        1
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 2,
      "text": "2.前往维诺亚村与研究员巴特（17.33）对话。（此步可省略）",
      "type": "optional-step",
      "sourceLines": [
        2
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 3,
      "text": "3.前往法兰城拿潘食品店（217.53）与粽子贩售商（17.13）对话，可交出1000G购买【肉粽】。",
      "type": "purchase-step",
      "sourceLines": [
        3
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 4,
      "text": "4.返回维诺亚村与研究院巴特对话，交出【肉粽】获得【裘瑟斯的信】。",
      "type": "exchange-step",
      "sourceLines": [
        4
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 5,
      "text": "5.返回法兰城凯蒂夫人店门口与裘瑟斯（195.69）对话，交出【裘瑟斯的信】获得【材料需求目录】。",
      "type": "exchange-step",
      "sourceLines": [
        5
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 6,
      "text": "6.前往亚留特村外寻找随机出现箬竹，持有【材料需求目录】时与之对话，获得【粽叶】。",
      "type": "held-item-acquisition",
      "sourceLines": [
        6
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 7,
      "text": "7.返回法兰城凯蒂夫人店门口与裘瑟斯对话，交出【材料需求目录】、【粽叶】获得【特制的粽子】。",
      "type": "combined-exchange",
      "sourceLines": [
        7
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 8,
      "text": "◆【特制的粽子】登出消失；持有【特制的粽子】时可使用各村落间的传送石",
      "type": "item-detail",
      "sourceLines": [
        8
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 9,
      "text": "8.前往维诺亚村与研究员巴特对话，交出【特制的粽子】获得【研究工具申请表】、【端午龙舟限定版】或【端午香包】。",
      "type": "combined-reward",
      "sourceLines": [
        9
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 10,
      "text": "◆【端午龙舟限定版】或【端午香包】为随机获得一种，【研究工具申请表】必定获得，皆无法交易",
      "type": "reward-rule",
      "sourceLines": [
        10
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 11,
      "text": "◆【端午龙舟限定版】：Lv.5护身符、攻击/防御/敏捷/回复/必杀/闪躲/反击/命中+1、生命+25、魔力+30、魅力+10、耐久140（数值浮动）；装备后获得称号“端阳幸运星”",
      "type": "reward-detail",
      "sourceLines": [
        11
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 12,
      "text": "◆【端午香包】：Lv.1护身符、毒+1、魅力-3、耐久100；装备后获得称号“童心未泯的人”",
      "type": "reward-detail",
      "sourceLines": [
        12
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 13,
      "text": "9.返回法兰城凯蒂夫人店门口，持有【研究工具申请表】时与裘瑟斯对话，选2次“是”交出【研究工具申请表】获得【鱼饵】。",
      "type": "branch-exchange",
      "sourceLines": [
        13
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 14,
      "text": "◆若选“否”则任务完结",
      "type": "branch-end",
      "sourceLines": [
        14
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 15,
      "text": "10.前往维诺亚村外布满青苔的洞窟入口处附近，持有【鱼饵】与捕鱼的少年（348.386）对话，传送至加蒂斯河。",
      "type": "held-item-teleport",
      "sourceLines": [
        15
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 16,
      "text": "◆加蒂斯河为随机迷宫，约8层；魔物为Lv.45以上水龙、蜥蜴斗士",
      "type": "encounter-area",
      "sourceLines": [
        16
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 17,
      "text": "11.通过随机迷宫抵达加蒂斯河最底层，与蛟龙（26.24）对话，无论选“是”或“否”皆会进入战斗。",
      "type": "battle-step",
      "sourceLines": [
        17
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 18,
      "text": "◆BOSS：Lv.60蛟龙，血量约6000；技能：攻击、防御、乾坤一掷、补血魔法、攻击反弹",
      "type": "battle-enemy",
      "sourceLines": [
        18
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 19,
      "text": "12.战斗胜利后与蛟龙（25.24）对话，交出【鱼饵】获得【研究工具】。再次与蛟龙对话，传送至维诺亚村。",
      "type": "exchange-step",
      "sourceLines": [
        19
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 20,
      "text": "13.与研究员巴特（17.33）对话，交出【研究工具】获得【端午香包】，任务完结。",
      "type": "completion-exchange",
      "sourceLines": [
        20
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 21,
      "text": "◆【端午香包】有两种不同的奖品，设计图类或配方类；设计图类香包双击后随机获得设计图，配方类香包有4点耐久，每次双击减少1点并随机获得配方",
      "type": "container-types",
      "sourceLines": [
        21
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 22,
      "text": "◆奖品明细：",
